<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Design for <math id="A1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>concat</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>reorder</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}</annotation></semantics></math></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>concat</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>reorder</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}</annotation></semantics></math> is our implementation of dKV-Cache designed to improve the speed of dKV-Cache in diffusion language models.
Unlike standard KV-Cache used in autoregressive models, dKV-Cache requires gathering and scattering keys and values from arbitrary positions, introducing indexing operations that are less efficient than the simple concatenation in contiguous space used in ARs.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In dKV-Cache, the cache process involves two additional indexing operations:
(1) At the cache step: After computing keys and values, we need to gather the corresponding states of cached tokens at non-continuous positions.
(2) At the reuse step: to obtain the whole matrices for key and value, we need to scatter these vectors back to their original positions in the sequence.
In contrast, KV-Cache in ARs only requires matrix slicing and concatenation, making it significantly more efficient.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">To minimize the overhead of gathering and scattering, we propose an algorithm similar to that of standard KV-Cache to avoid too many indexing operations.
The key idea is to reorder token positions during the forward calculation of the Transformer, placing all cached tokens contiguously on one side (e.g., left) and newly decoded tokens on the other.
This allows us to move parts of the indexing operation to the token level (matrices with shape [B, L]) instead of the intermediate states (matrices with shape [B, L, D]):</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At Step t-1: Gather the cached key <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math> and value states <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math> based on the position index <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math> with one indexing operation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At Step t: Reorder the sequence, making the cached tokens (at position <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>) at the left, and uncached tokens (at position <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>) at the right.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">At Step t: Using <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>concat</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>reorder</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\operatorname{concat\_{reorder}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and for <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>:
First, concatenate the cached and current key/value states directly without further gathering/scattering (<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">concat</span>, for getting all K and V to calculate attention),
and reorder the whole KV matrics based on <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math> to get the cached states for the next step (<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">reorder</span>, for obtaining the cache).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A1.p3.2" class="ltx_p">The reorder operation is to know the position mapping from <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1};\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>;</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1};\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="A1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t};\mathcal{M}_{t}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>;</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t};\mathcal{M}_{t}]</annotation></semantics></math>.
For example, if the unmasked position at <math id="A1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t-1</annotation></semantics></math> is [2, 4, 5] from a sequence of 8 tokens, and at step <math id="A1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t+1</annotation></semantics></math> is [2, 4, 5, 7].
Then <math id="A1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1};\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>;</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1};\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]</annotation></semantics></math> would be [2, 4, 5, 0, 1, 3, 6, 7], and <math id="A1.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t};\mathcal{M}_{t}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo>;</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t};\mathcal{M}_{t}]</annotation></semantics></math> would be [2, 4, 5, 7, 0, 1, 3, 6].
The mapping would be [0, 1, 2, 7, 3, 4, 5, 6], and we only need to get the corresponding entries [0, 1, 2, 7] from <math id="A1.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}};\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>[</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}};\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left[\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}};\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>[</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left[\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}};\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right]</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The only remaining thing is that the change of token position would impact the positional encoding.
However, this is easy to solve; we can also reorder the positional embedding.
Reordering positional embeddings is required only once per model evaluation and can be shared across layers, thus, it would not cost much time.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Furthermore, since our method introduces a one-step shift in caching, the position of cached tokens at step <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the token positions decoded from step <math id="A1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t-1</annotation></semantics></math>. This alignment allows us to track which key and value entries need to be cached without storing the entire key/value matrices, which, to cache which tokens, can only be known after the decoding results at step <math id="A1.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">We present the pseudo-algorithm of our approach in Algorithm  <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Design for concat⁢_⁢reorder ‣ dKV-Cache: The Cache for Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. While it largely improves inference speed over the naive implementation, the concat and reorder operations still introduce some overhead. We believe there is substantial potential for further optimization.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Pseudo code for dKV-Cache-Decode. We take step t as an example.</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          Sequence <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{c(t)}^{1:L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{c(t)}^{1:L}</annotation></semantics></math> at step <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> (Simplied as <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math>), position index of masked tokens <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>, cached Key <math id="alg1.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐊</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math> and Value <math id="alg1.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐕</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}^{\prime}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}^{\prime}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{t-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{t-1}</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="alg1.l2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t-1</annotation></semantics></math> for one-step shift
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textbf{PE}^{\prime}\;\leftarrow\;\bigl[\textbf{PE}[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\;;\;\textbf{PE}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\bigr]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">PE</mtext><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">PE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_bold">PE</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textbf{PE}^{\prime}\;\leftarrow\;\bigl[\textbf{PE}[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\;;\;\textbf{PE}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Positional embeddings: cached on left, uncached on right
</span></span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Q}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}(\mathbf{x}^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐐</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒯</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Q}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\mathcal{T}(\mathbf{x}^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math>: Calculation in Transformer to get Q, K and V
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Concat}\left(\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Concat</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Concat}\left(\mathbf{K}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Concat}\left(\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Concat</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Concat}\left(\mathbf{V}_{t-1}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t-1}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Get all K and V
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Reorder}(\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},I^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Reorder</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Reorder}(\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},I^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Reorder}(\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},I^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Reorder</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}\leftarrow\operatorname{Reorder}(\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},I^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I^{\prime}}:" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I^{\prime}}:</annotation></semantics></math> The index of <math id="alg1.l6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> in the <math id="alg1.l6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bigl[\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\;;\;\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\bigr]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="1.330em" minsize="1.330em">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.447em">;</mo><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.330em" minsize="1.330em">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bigl[\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\;;\;\mathbf{x}[\mathcal{M}_{t-1}]\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime}\leftarrow\mathcal{A}(\mathbf{Q}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒜</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐐</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime}\leftarrow\mathcal{A}(\mathbf{Q}_{t}^{\mathcal{M}_{t}},\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}},\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\leftarrow\operatorname{Scatter}(p^{\prime},\mathcal{M}_{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">Scatter</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\leftarrow\operatorname{Scatter}(p^{\prime},\mathcal{M}_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Put the token logits back to the original position
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Return</span><span id="alg1.l9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐊</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l9.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="alg1.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐕</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℐ</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∖</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℳ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{V}_{t}^{\mathcal{I}\setminus\mathcal{M}_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l9.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
